# MagicSquare Project Rules

## Scope
- Project language is Python only.
- Python version must be 3.13 or newer.

## Delivery Goals
- Keep focus on clean architecture and test-driven confidence.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes.

## AI Workflow Requirements
- Follow explicit Red -> Green -> Refactor flow for behavior changes.
- Do not claim completion without relevant test evidence.
- Explain phase transitions on substantial changes.
